vendor/ contains eSpeak NG 1.52.0 from espeak-ng/espeak-ng commit
4870adfa25b1a32b4361592f1be8a40337c58d6c. See vendor/README.md and
vendor/COPYING* for upstream copyright and license notices. The repository
preserves the notices and licenses of the third-party materials in that source
tree. The Wasm uses the eSpeak NG library, its Unicode support, the compiled
English dictionary and phoneme tables, and its en-US and en-GB voice definitions.

src/bridge.c is the ReadHalo parity prototype bridge. src/module.c adapts
punctuation preservation and output processing from Phonemizer, copyright
2015–2021 Mathieu Bernard, GPL-3.0-or-later. Reference distribution:
phonemizer-fork 3.3.2, https://pypi.org/project/phonemizer-fork/3.3.2/.
